		(descr "Reverse-mount 1206 LED, e.g. XINGLIGHT XL-3216UWC-FB (LCSC C3646935). Mount on the opposite side of the board, the lens shines through the 2.2 x 1.9 mm cutout. Geometry after the JLCPCB/EasyEDA footprint LED-SMD_L3.2-W1.6-RD-EH (pads 1.0 x 1.524 mm at +-1.651 mm, cutout 2.2 x 1.9 mm): pad inner edge moved to 1.3 mm for 0.2 mm copper-to-cutout clearance, cutout corners r = 0.5 mm for milling. Pad 1 = cathode.")
